### =============================================
### Card Transaction API Tests
### IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client
### =============================================

### ---------------------------------------------
### 카드 결제 문자 등록 (삼성카드)
### ---------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/v1/card/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "01012345678",
  "message": "[Web발신]\n삼성카드 승인\n홍*동\n15,000원 일시불\n01/15 14:30\n스타벅스강남점\n누적 150,000원"
}

### ---------------------------------------------
### 카드 결제 문자 등록 (현대카드)
### ---------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/v1/card/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "01012345678",
  "message": "[Web발신]\n현대카드 승인\n김*수\n32,500원 일시불\n01/15 18:45\n이마트용산점\n누적 500,000원"
}

### ---------------------------------------------
### 카드 결제 문자 등록 (KB국민카드)
### ---------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/v1/card/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "01012345678",
  "message": "[Web발신]\nKB국민카드 승인\n박*영\n8,900원 일시불\n01/15 12:00\n GS25편의점\n누적 80,000원"
}

### ---------------------------------------------
### 전체 거래 내역 조회
### ---------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/v1/card/transactions
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------
### 특정 거래 조회 (ID로 조회)
### ---------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/v1/card/transactions/1
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------
### 카드사별 거래 조회 (삼성카드)
### ---------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/v1/card/transactions/by-company/SAMSUNG
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------
### 카드사별 거래 조회 (현대카드)
### ---------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/v1/card/transactions/by-company/HYUNDAI
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------
